[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/964448541","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349#issuecomment-964448541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349","id":964448541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE845fFEd","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-11-09T19:05:05Z","updated_at":"2021-11-09T19:05:05Z","body":"# New submission review\r\n\r\n## Has the license been approved by the OSI?\r\n* No, it was submitted and rejected\r\n\r\n## Definitive factors\r\n*These must all be satisfied to allow inclusion in the license list*\r\n\r\n### Is the submitted license unique, that is, it does not match another license already on the License List as per the matching guidelines? \r\n* No\r\n\r\n### If a software license, does it apply to source code and not only to executables?\r\n* Yes\r\n\r\n### Does the license have identifiable and stable text, and is not in the midst of drafting?\r\n* appears to be so\r\n\r\n### Has the license steward, if any, committed to versioning new versions in the future and to not modify it after addition to the list?\r\n* appears so, as it is versioned\r\n\r\n## Other factors for inclusion\r\n*Roughly in order of descending importance*\r\n\r\n### 1. Does the license substantially comply with one of the free/open content definitions?\r\n* no, this clause put a restriction on use, \"You may not provide the software to third parties as a hosted or managed service, where the service provides users with access to any substantial set of the features or functionality of the software.\"\r\n\r\n### 2. Does the license have substantial use such that it is likely to be encountered (ie. use in many projects, or in one significant project)?\r\n* it is used for a substantially popular project\r\n\r\n### 3. Is the license structured to be generally usable by anyone, and not specific to one organisation or project?\r\n* yes, although I don't know of any other project that uses it\r\n\r\n### 4. Is the license primarily intended to facilitate the free distribution of content with limited restrictions?\r\n* I think it's roughly a \"source available\" license with the one use restriction\r\n\r\n### 5. Does the license steward support this submission, or is at least aware of and not in opposition of it?\r\n* not sure\r\n\r\n## Summary of factors / outcome\r\n* would be good to get a comment from a rep of Elastic on stability, versioning, and if any other project uses it before making a determination","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/964448541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/964709158","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349#issuecomment-964709158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349","id":964709158,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE845gEsm","user":{"login":"xeraa","id":432211,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjIxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432211?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa","html_url":"https://github.com/xeraa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-11-10T01:55:55Z","updated_at":"2021-11-10T01:55:55Z","body":"I work for Elastic and we would welcome the addition. Answering the open questions below:\r\n\r\n> Has the license been approved by the OSI?\r\n\r\nIt has not been submitted to OSI (and thus not rejected) — is there another status than yes / no?\r\n\r\n> Is the submitted license unique, that is, it does not match another license already on the License List as per the matching guidelines?\r\n\r\nTo our knowledge it is unique and the reason why Heather Meeker created it for Elastic ([related whitepaper](https://www.coss.community/cossc/elastic-license-2-0-and-the-evolution-of-open-source-licensing-3jb3)).\r\n\r\n> Does the license have identifiable and stable text, and is not in the midst of drafting?\r\n\r\nYes, this is the stable license.\r\n\r\n> Has the license steward, if any, committed to versioning new versions in the future and to not modify it after addition to the list?\r\n\r\nYes, it is versioned.\r\n\r\n> 2. Does the license have substantial use such that it is likely to be encountered (ie. use in many projects, or in one significant project)?\r\n\r\nBesides Elastic's own projects (including https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch, https://github.com/elastic/kibana, https://github.com/elastic/eui,...) it is used for example in:\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/StarRocks/starrocks\r\n* https://github.com/airbytehq/airbyte\r\n* https://github.com/apollographql/federation\r\n\r\n> 5. Does the license steward support this submission, or is at least aware of and not in opposition of it?\r\n\r\nWe support it!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/964709158/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1000405502","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349#issuecomment-1000405502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349","id":1000405502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE847oPn-","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-12-23T16:20:00Z","updated_at":"2021-12-23T16:20:00Z","body":"re: OSI submission,  I believe our submission form does have a \"not submitted\" option, but that wasn't picked. In any case, thanks for the clarification.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1000405502/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1000406773","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349#issuecomment-1000406773","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349","id":1000406773,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE847oP71","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-12-23T16:22:25Z","updated_at":"2021-12-23T16:22:25Z","body":"and there are two use restrictions which would make it not free/open:\r\n\r\n\"You may not provide the software to third parties as a hosted or managed service, where the service provides users with access to any substantial set of the features or functionality of the software.\r\n\r\nYou may not move, change, disable, or circumvent the license key functionality in the software, and you may not remove or obscure any functionality in the software that is protected by the license key.\"","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1000406773/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1000416325","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349#issuecomment-1000416325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349","id":1000416325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE847oSRF","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-12-23T16:40:51Z","updated_at":"2021-12-23T16:40:51Z","body":"Agree with @jlovejoy's [analysis above](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349#issuecomment-964448541).\r\n\r\nGiven the usage by some significant projects, I think the balance of factors in that analysis and the follow-up comments tilts in favor of adding it to the list.\r\n\r\nOne comment: I'd lean towards \"Elastic-2.0\" as the short identifier, rather than \"ELv2\". SPDX generally uses \"-X.Y\" suffixes to denote licensing, and I think it will be clearer to specify \"Elastic\" rather than \"EL\" which is close to the commonly-used \"EPL-2.0\" (Eclipse).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1000416325/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1000669764","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349#issuecomment-1000669764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349","id":1000669764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE847pQJE","user":{"login":"xeraa","id":432211,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMjIxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432211?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa","html_url":"https://github.com/xeraa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xeraa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-12-24T05:57:38Z","updated_at":"2021-12-24T05:57:38Z","body":"I don't think we plan on having minor versions of the license, but if you standardize on \"-X.Y\" we can go with that.\r\n\r\nMost licenses seem to use an abbreviation that's why we thought that \"EL\" would make sense here.\r\n\r\nThanks a lot for moving this forward :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1000669764/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1000918359","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349#issuecomment-1000918359","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1349","id":1000918359,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE847qM1X","user":{"login":"silverhook","id":3227264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjcyNjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3227264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook","html_url":"https://github.com/silverhook","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silverhook/received_events","type":"U